hpc:LsfTcpKeepaliveTime rdfs:range xsd:integer .

hpc:LsfStripDomain rdfs:range xsd:string .


This ontology fragment defines three classes: `hpc:LSF_STRIP_DOMAIN`, `hpc:EGO_STRIP_DOMAIN`, and `hpc:LSF_TCP_KEEPALIVE_TIME`. It also declares two object properties (`hpc:LSF`) and two datatype properties (`hpc:LSF_STRIP_DOMAIN` and `hpc:LSF_TCP_KEEPALIVE_TIME`). The `hpc:LSF_STRIP_DOMAIN` and `hpc:LSF_TCP_KEEPALIVE_TIME` properties have their domain set to `hpc:LSF`, and their range is defined accordingly. The `hpc:LSF_STRIP_DOMAIN` property also has its range set to `xsd:string`.
